<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle at standstill - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle at standstill - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the Panhandle area early Wednesday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reporting moderate inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>There were 35,700 head confirmed for the week to date including 29,500 formulated cattle to be shipped this week. Confirmed - None.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
